# Language-crew worktrees. They are meant to live as SIBLINGS of this repo, but
# broken worktree metadata has left full copies nested inside the root before —
# each one a whole repo with its own node_modules and public/audio. Ignore them
# so `git status` stays readable and nothing gets committed by accident.
/lingua-*/
/drill-tools/

# Debug screenshots from manual UI checks. They were committed to the repo root
# once (~1.2 MB) as scope creep in a fix commit; keep them out.
/shot-*.png

# Playtest screenshots. Debug artifacts, not source — 13 MB of them reached a
# commit on 2026-09-16 because a `git add -A` in this shared working tree swept
# another live session's output. Ignored so it cannot happen again; the files
# stay on disk for whoever is using them.
/shots/
/shots-deep/
/shots-ladder/

# Agent worktrees. Embedded git repos — a `git add -A` in this shared tree turns
# each into a broken submodule pointer. Committed by accident 2026-09-16; ignored
# so it cannot recur. The directories themselves are transient and agent-owned.
/.claude/worktrees/
